  "No toast or subtitle code change. ActionParamDialog.tsx and useConsoleActionRuntime.tsx are untouched because no objectui defect was found there. The dispatch's toast-fix ablation therefore has nothing to ablate. Both claims are pinned end to end with controls instead.",
  "The anchor fix covers its whole class inside the link cell, not only email: url, phone, the file family (found by the census) and references. This is the same defect class, a mechanical fix, files no other claim holds, and the same gate family. The file is named here and in the PR body (packages/plugin-grid/src/ObjectGrid.tsx LinkCell, and cellRendererResolution.ts). Subagent mode had no channel to name it to the seat before editing.",
